@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：UNKNOWN 默认停止重试，避免重复消息

actor Caller
participant MessageTemplate as Template
participant DefaultReliableMessageSender as Sender
participant RetryExecutor as Retry
participant MessageProvider as Provider
queue Broker
participant MessageSendRetryClassifier as Classifier

Caller -> Template: send()
Template -> Sender: send(prepared)
Sender -> Retry: execute(message-send)
Retry -> Sender: attempt #1
Sender -> Provider: provider.send(request)
Provider -> Broker: publish request may arrive
Broker --x Provider: ack lost / response timeout
Provider --> Sender: ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
Retry -> Classifier: classify(UNKNOWN)

alt retryWhenUnknown=false
  Classifier --> Retry: STOP / UNKNOWN
  Retry --> Sender: RetryResult.NOT_RETRYABLE
  Sender --> Template: SendResult.UNKNOWN
  Template --> Caller: UNKNOWN
else retryWhenUnknown=true
  Classifier --> Retry: RETRY
  Retry -> Retry: backoff
  Retry -> Sender: attempt #2
end

note over Caller,Broker
UNKNOWN 表示“无法确认 Broker 是否收到”。
默认 STOP 是保守策略：宁愿暴露 UNKNOWN，也不在没有幂等/Outbox 前制造重复消息。
end note
@enduml
